* TYPE - PRIVATE RESIDENT TEXT DISPLAY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* TYPE - PRIVATE RESIDENT TEXT DISPLAY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    TYPE filespec

The resident RCP text display command is wheel-protected. It reads an
ordinary text file using the resident implementation; it is distinct from
public A0:TYPE.COM.

To select the public CP/M program explicitly, use A0:TYPE filespec. Public
HELP TYPE documents that program and its CP/M 3 options. Do not assume
those options apply to the resident implementation.

Keep wheel disabled for caller sessions. Use LT for supported compressed
text or library members.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
